<title>INDIA: India M&amp;M 1996/97 results on June 10.</title>
<headline>India M&amp;M 1996/97 results on June 10.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-05-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Utility vehicle and tractor maker Mahindra and Mahindra Ltd said on Friday its board will meet on June 10 to finalise accounts for the year ended March 31, 1997.</p>
<p>Analysts have forecast net profit to rise 23.7 percent to 2.08 billion rupees in 1996/97 from 1.68 billion a year ago, a recent Reuter poll showed.</p>
<p>--Bombay newsroom +91-22-265-9000</p>
